1
00:00:00,346 --> 00:00:02,949
Bugungi videoda nima bor?

2
00:00:03,276 --> 00:00:06,784
Solishtirma suhbat. Qaysi biri yaxshiroq?

3
00:00:07,337 --> 00:00:08,837
1-Sahna: Kiyim oʻlchami va rangini tanlash

4
00:00:08,837 --> 00:00:11,470
Qarang.

5
00:00:11,493 --> 00:00:15,326
Bu koʻylak juda chiroyli, shunday emasmi?

6
00:00:15,349 --> 00:00:18,416
Rostdan ham.

7
00:00:18,439 --> 00:00:22,476
Qizil va koʻk ranglari bor.

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,439
Qaysi biri yoqadi?

9
00:00:25,462 --> 00:00:31,411
Hmm… Menga koʻk rang koʻproq yoqadi.

10
00:00:31,435 --> 00:00:33,938
Shundaymi?

11
00:00:33,961 --> 00:00:38,994
Koʻk rang qizildan bir oz kattaroq ekan.

12
00:00:39,017 --> 00:00:41,957
Rostdan.

13
00:00:41,981 --> 00:00:45,514
Koʻk rang L oʻlchamda.

14
00:00:45,537 --> 00:00:48,915
Qizil rang esa M oʻlchamda.

15
00:00:48,938 --> 00:00:52,672
Menga M oʻlcham mos keladi.

16
00:00:52,695 --> 00:00:56,928
Unda qizil rang yaxshi boʻlardi.

17
00:00:56,951 --> 00:01:02,418
Lekin koʻk rang rangi chiroyliroq.

18
00:01:02,441 --> 00:01:04,781
Shunday.

19
00:01:04,805 --> 00:01:07,982
Qaysi biri arzonroq?

20
00:01:08,005 --> 00:01:11,105
Narxini koʻraylik.

21
00:01:11,128 --> 00:01:15,195
Koʻk rang uch ming yen.

22
00:01:15,218 --> 00:01:18,051
Qizil rang qancha?

23
00:01:18,074 --> 00:01:22,147
Qizil rang ikki ming besh yuz yen.

24
00:01:22,171 --> 00:01:26,238
Qizil rang koʻk rangdan arzonroq ekan.

25
00:01:26,261 --> 00:01:30,527
Ha, lekin qaysi birini tanlashda qiynalaman.

26
00:01:30,550 --> 00:01:35,323
Saki, odatda qanday rangdagi kiyimlar kiyasiz?

27
00:01:35,347 --> 00:01:39,780
Odatda qora yoki oq kiyaman.

28
00:01:39,803 --> 00:01:44,310
Unda qizil rang yorqinroq va yaxshi boʻlardi.

29
00:01:44,334 --> 00:01:46,568
Shunday.

30
00:01:46,591 --> 00:01:50,224
Qizil rang — jonli rang.

31
00:01:50,247 --> 00:01:54,187
Ha, juda mos keladi deb oʻylayman.

32
00:01:54,210 --> 00:01:59,204
Lekin koʻk rang ham salqin rang, yoqadi.

33
00:01:59,227 --> 00:02:02,327
Bir marta kiyib koʻrasizmi?

34
00:02:02,350 --> 00:02:05,347
Ha, shunday qilaman.

35
00:02:05,371 --> 00:02:08,642
Doʻkon xodimini chaqiramiz.

36
00:02:08,666 --> 00:02:12,381
Doʻkon xodimi u yerda turibdi.

37
00:02:12,404 --> 00:02:17,271
Kechirasiz, buni kiyib koʻrishim mumkinmi?

38
00:02:17,294 --> 00:02:20,685
Ha, iltimos.

39
00:02:20,708 --> 00:02:23,741
Kiyish xonasi shu tomonda.

40
00:02:23,764 --> 00:02:26,398
Qaysi birini kiyasiz?

41
00:02:26,421 --> 00:02:29,988
Avval qizil rangni kiyaman.

42
00:02:30,012 --> 00:02:33,359
Keyin koʻk rangni kiyaman.

43
00:02:33,382 --> 00:02:35,518
Yaxshi.

44
00:02:35,541 --> 00:02:39,574
Qaysi biri eng yaxshi kelishini koʻraylik.

45
00:02:39,597 --> 00:02:42,067
Rahmat.

46
00:02:42,091 --> 00:02:45,191
Kuting, iltimos.

47
00:02:45,214 --> 00:02:49,047
Ha, shoshilmang.

48
00:02:49,070 --> 00:02:51,570
Qiziqib ketyapman.

49
00:02:51,593 --> 00:02:53,093
2-Sahna: Tushlikni tanlash

50
00:02:53,093 --> 00:02:56,760
Qorni ochdi, shunday emasmi?

51
00:02:56,782 --> 00:03:00,816
Ha. Biror narsa yeyish kerak.

52
00:03:00,839 --> 00:03:04,638
Ushbu restoranga kirib koʻrmaymizmi?

53
00:03:04,662 --> 00:03:07,395
Yaxshi.

54
00:03:07,418 --> 00:03:10,576
Menyuni koʻraylik.

55
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:15,932
Goʻshtli va baliqli tushliklar bor.

56
00:03:15,955 --> 00:03:19,023
Qaysi birini xohlaysiz?

57
00:03:19,047 --> 00:03:24,914
Men goʻsht ham, baliq ham yoqadi.

58
00:03:24,938 --> 00:03:27,973
Men ham.

59
00:03:27,997 --> 00:03:30,540
Qiyin qaror ekanku.

60
00:03:30,564 --> 00:03:34,479
Goʻshtli tushlik ming yen.

61
00:03:34,503 --> 00:03:38,936
Baliqli tushlik sakkiz yuz yen.

62
00:03:38,959 --> 00:03:42,492
Baliq arzonroq ekan.

63
00:03:42,515 --> 00:03:47,689
Ha. Ammo goʻshtliroqroq.

64
00:03:47,713 --> 00:03:50,083
Shunday.

65
00:03:50,106 --> 00:03:54,206
Bugun koʻp ovqatlanmoqchiman.

66
00:03:54,229 --> 00:03:58,096
Unda, goʻsht yaxshiroqmi?

67
00:03:58,119 --> 00:04:03,652
Hmm… lekin baliq ham mazali koʻrinayapti.

68
00:04:03,675 --> 00:04:07,951
Bu doʻkonda baliq juda mashhur.

69
00:04:07,974 --> 00:04:11,124
Rostdanmi?

70
00:04:11,147 --> 00:04:15,181
Unda, baliq yaxshiroq boʻladi.

71
00:04:15,204 --> 00:04:21,917
Menyuda eng mashhuri – baliqli tushlik.

72
00:04:21,941 --> 00:04:25,841
Shunda men baliqni tanlayman.

73
00:04:25,864 --> 00:04:28,897
Men goʻshtni tanlayman.

74
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:33,513
Chunki kecha uyda baliq yedim.

75
00:04:33,536 --> 00:04:36,322
Shundaymi?

76
00:04:36,346 --> 00:04:40,283
Goʻshtli tushlik ham mazali boʻlsa yaxshi.

77
00:04:40,306 --> 00:04:42,773
Ha.

78
00:04:42,796 --> 00:04:46,764
A, ichimlik ham tanlash kerak.

79
00:04:46,787 --> 00:04:50,367
Kofe va choy bor.

80
00:04:50,391 --> 00:04:54,291
Men sovuq choy ichishni xohlayman.

81
00:04:54,314 --> 00:04:58,467
Menyuda choy ham bor.

82
00:04:58,490 --> 00:05:01,045
Yuz yen.

83
00:05:01,069 --> 00:05:03,735
Yaxshi ekan.

84
00:05:03,758 --> 00:05:06,834
Shunda choy bering, iltimos.

85
00:05:06,857 --> 00:05:11,174
Men ovqatdan keyin kofe ichaman.

86
00:05:11,198 --> 00:05:13,752
Yaxshi.

87
00:05:13,775 --> 00:05:17,809
Ofitsantni chaqirib qoʻysakmi?

88
00:05:17,832 --> 00:05:22,023
Kechirasiz, buyurtma beramiz.

89
00:05:22,046 --> 00:05:27,523
Baliqli va goʻshtli tushlikdan bittadan bering.

90
00:05:27,547 --> 00:05:32,980
Shuningdek, choy va kofedan bittadan iltimos.

91
00:05:33,003 --> 00:05:34,503
3-sahna: Fasllarga boʻlgan munosabat / Fasllarga boʻlgan afzalliklar

92
00:05:34,503 --> 00:05:39,437
Bugun ob-havo juda yaxshi, shunday emasmi?

93
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:44,393
Ha, shamol juda yoqimli esayapti.

94
00:05:44,416 --> 00:05:48,950
Bahor mening eng sevimli faslim.

95
00:05:48,974 --> 00:05:55,607
Rostdanmi? Siz uchun yilning eng yaxshi fasli bahormi?

96
00:05:55,630 --> 00:06:01,863
Ha. Chunki iliq va gullar juda chiroyli.

97
00:06:01,886 --> 00:06:08,005
Men bahordan koʻra kuzni koʻproq yaxshi koʻraman.

98
00:06:08,029 --> 00:06:10,495
Nega?

99
00:06:10,518 --> 00:06:14,475
Kuz ham salqin.

100
00:06:14,499 --> 00:06:18,833
Va ovqatlar ham juda mazali.

101
00:06:18,856 --> 00:06:23,766
Rost. Mevalar ham juda mazali.

102
00:06:23,790 --> 00:06:28,739
Yoz va qishdan qaysi birini yaxshi koʻrasiz?

103
00:06:28,763 --> 00:06:34,748
Hmm… men yozni koʻproq yaxshi koʻraman.

104
00:06:34,771 --> 00:06:40,204
Shundaymi? Yozda juda issiq boʻladi-ku.

105
00:06:40,227 --> 00:06:45,794
Ha, lekin dengizda suzish mumkin.

106
00:06:45,817 --> 00:06:53,550
Men qishni yozga qaraganda koʻproq yaxshi koʻraman. Sovuq emasmi?

107
00:06:53,573 --> 00:06:59,051
Sovuq, lekin qor koʻrish mumkin.

108
00:06:59,075 --> 00:07:02,263
Qor juda chiroyli, shunday emasmi?

109
00:07:02,286 --> 00:07:07,153
Mening yurtimda qor yoʻq.

110
00:07:07,176 --> 00:07:09,843
Rostdanmi?

111
00:07:09,866 --> 00:07:14,904
Yilning qaysi fasli eng issiq?

112
00:07:14,927 --> 00:07:19,236
Iyul eng issiq oy.

113
00:07:19,260 --> 00:07:23,493
Har kuni harorat 30 darajadan oshadi.

114
00:07:23,516 --> 00:07:26,830
Bu juda qiyin boʻlsa kerak.

115
00:07:26,853 --> 00:07:34,605
Ha. Shuning uchun Yaponiyaning bahori haqiqatan ham ajoyib.

116
00:07:34,629 --> 00:07:36,896
Yaxshi boʻldi.

117
00:07:36,919 --> 00:07:41,462
Bu hafta oxiri qayerga borasizmi?

118
00:07:41,486 --> 00:07:46,391
Ha, bogʻga gulli olcha koʻrishga boraman.

119
00:07:46,414 --> 00:07:48,804
Yaxshi.

120
00:07:48,827 --> 00:07:51,960
Kim bilan borasiz?

121
00:07:51,983 --> 00:07:55,131
Doʻstlarim bilan boraman.

122
00:07:55,155 --> 00:07:58,788
Ovqat olib borasizmi?

123
00:07:58,811 --> 00:08:02,847
Ha, koʻp pishiraman.

124
00:08:02,871 --> 00:08:05,538
Juda qiziqarli koʻrinadi.

125
00:08:05,561 --> 00:08:09,241
Keyinroq rasmlarni koʻrsatib qoʻying.

126
00:08:09,264 --> 00:08:13,242
Albatta, koʻp suratga olaman.

127
00:08:13,265 --> 00:08:16,175
Ob-havo yaxshi boʻlsa yaxshi boʻlardi.

128
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:20,108
Ha, havo ochiq boʻladi deb oʻylayman.

129
00:08:20,131 --> 00:08:21,631
4-SAHNA: Sanʼat muzeyiga qanday borish mumkin

130
00:08:21,631 --> 00:08:26,998
Bu shanba sanʼat muzeyiga boring.

131
00:08:27,021 --> 00:08:29,487
Yaxshi.

132
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:32,882
Qanday borish mumkin?

133
00:08:32,906 --> 00:08:37,006
Poyezd va avtobusda borish mumkin.

134
00:08:37,029 --> 00:08:40,129
Qaysi qulayroq?

135
00:08:40,152 --> 00:08:44,618
Poyezd avtobusga qaraganda tezroq.

136
00:08:44,641 --> 00:08:47,991
Necha daqiqa ketadi?

137
00:08:48,015 --> 00:08:52,148
Poyezdda taxminan 30 daqiqa.

138
00:08:52,171 --> 00:08:55,204
Avtobusda qanday?

139
00:08:55,227 --> 00:08:59,369
Avtobusda bir soat ketadi.

140
00:08:59,392 --> 00:09:03,626
Poyezd ancha tez ekan.

141
00:09:03,649 --> 00:09:10,115
Ha, lekin avtobus poyezdga qaraganda arzonroq.

142
00:09:10,138 --> 00:09:12,572
Narxi qancha?

143
00:09:12,595 --> 00:09:16,261
Avtobus 200 yen.

144
00:09:16,284 --> 00:09:19,518
Poyezd 500 yen.

145
00:09:19,541 --> 00:09:23,207
Farqi anchagina katta ekan.

146
00:09:23,230 --> 00:09:27,068
Ha, qaysi birini afzal koʻrasiz?

147
00:09:27,091 --> 00:09:31,233
Men arzonroqini afzal koʻraman.

148
00:09:31,257 --> 00:09:35,336
Unda, avtobusda boramizmi?

149
00:09:35,359 --> 00:09:39,871
Lekin shanba kuni yoʻllar tirband boʻladi.

150
00:09:39,894 --> 00:09:42,773
Ha, shunday ekan.

151
00:09:42,797 --> 00:09:46,154
Vaqt koʻproq ketadi.

152
00:09:46,178 --> 00:09:51,611
Unda, poyezd afzalroq boʻlishi mumkin.

153
00:09:51,634 --> 00:09:53,901
Tushunarli.

154
00:09:53,924 --> 00:09:57,257
Poyezdda boramiz.

155
00:09:57,281 --> 00:10:00,714
Bekatda uchrashamizmi?

156
00:10:00,737 --> 00:10:04,840
Ha, necha soatda yigʻilamiz?

157
00:10:04,864 --> 00:10:08,781
Sanʼat muzeyi soat o‘nga ochiladi.

158
00:10:08,804 --> 00:10:11,571
To‘qqizda qanday?

159
00:10:11,594 --> 00:10:14,433
Yaxshi.

160
00:10:14,457 --> 00:10:18,642
To‘qqizda vokzalning kirish joyida uchrashamiz.

161
00:10:18,665 --> 00:10:22,298
Tushlikni qayerda yeymiz?

162
00:10:22,321 --> 00:10:27,034
Muzeyning yaqinida mazali ovqatlanish joyi bor.

163
00:10:27,058 --> 00:10:31,558
Restoran va kafe, qaysi biri yaxshi?

164
00:10:31,581 --> 00:10:35,481
Kafe ancha tinchroq bo‘ladi.

165
00:10:35,504 --> 00:10:37,902
Yaxshi.

166
00:10:37,926 --> 00:10:40,992
Juda kutaman.

167
00:10:41,015 --> 00:10:43,653
Men ham.

168
00:10:43,676 --> 00:10:45,176
5-Sahna: Tokio va qishloq hayotini solishtirish

169
00:10:45,176 --> 00:10:49,310
Tokiodagi hayot qanday?

170
00:10:49,333 --> 00:10:54,881
Qiziqarli, lekin odamlar juda ko‘p.

171
00:10:54,904 --> 00:10:57,570
Shunday.

172
00:10:57,593 --> 00:11:01,565
Har kuni poyezdlar gavjum bo‘ladi.

173
00:11:01,589 --> 00:11:07,540
Mening shahrim Tokioga qaraganda ancha tinch.

174
00:11:07,564 --> 00:11:10,554
Qanday shahar?

175
00:11:10,578 --> 00:11:15,680
Tog‘lar go‘zal, havo toza.

176
00:11:15,703 --> 00:11:18,413
Yaxshi.

177
00:11:18,437 --> 00:11:23,987
Tokio va sizning shahringiz, qaysi biri yoqadi?

178
00:11:24,010 --> 00:11:26,948
Ikkalasi ham yoqadi.

179
00:11:26,971 --> 00:11:32,084
Lekin mening shahrimda ko‘proq tinchlik bor.

180
00:11:32,108 --> 00:11:35,642
Xarid qilish qanday?

181
00:11:35,665 --> 00:11:42,617
Xarid qilish qulayligi jihatidan Tokio mening shahrimdan yaxshiroq.

182
00:11:42,641 --> 00:11:46,951
Chunki do‘konlar juda ko‘p.

183
00:11:46,974 --> 00:11:49,007
Ha.

184
00:11:49,030 --> 00:11:54,530
Lekin narxlar Tokioda qimmatroq.

185
00:11:54,553 --> 00:11:59,253
Ijara haqi ham Tokioda eng qimmat deb o‘ylayman.

186
00:11:59,276 --> 00:12:02,243
Rostdan ham shunday.

187
00:12:02,266 --> 00:12:06,366
Mening shahrimda ijara arzon.

188
00:12:06,389 --> 00:12:10,022
Taomlar qanday?

189
00:12:10,045 --> 00:12:13,479
Qaysi biri mazaliroq?

190
00:12:13,502 --> 00:12:18,568
Sabzavotlar mening shahrimdagidan mazaliroq.

191
00:12:18,591 --> 00:12:21,625
Chunki yangi.

192
00:12:21,648 --> 00:12:25,914
Restoranlar Tokioda ko‘proq.

193
00:12:25,937 --> 00:12:28,171
Ha.

194
00:12:28,194 --> 00:12:33,028
Turli mamlakatlarning taomlarini tatib ko‘rish mumkin.

195
00:12:33,051 --> 00:12:37,084
Bu Tokioning yaxshi tomoni.

196
00:12:37,107 --> 00:12:42,808
Keyingi dam olish kunida mening shaharga tashrif buyurib ko‘rmaysizmi?

197
00:12:42,832 --> 00:12:45,103
Eh?

198
00:12:45,126 --> 00:12:47,393
Rostdan ham bo‘ladimi?

199
00:12:47,416 --> 00:12:49,649
Ha.

200
00:12:49,672 --> 00:12:54,706
Mashinada turli joylarga olib boraman.

201
00:12:54,728 --> 00:12:57,228
Juda xursandman.

202
00:12:57,251 --> 00:12:59,585
Rahmat.

203
00:12:59,608 --> 00:13:05,342
Shahardagi eng mazali lag‘mon do‘koniga boring.

204
00:13:05,365 --> 00:13:09,319
Lag‘monni juda yaxshi ko‘raman.

205
00:13:09,343 --> 00:13:12,649
Albatta yoqadi deb o‘ylayman.

206
00:13:12,673 --> 00:13:15,908
Issiq buloq bormi?

207
00:13:15,931 --> 00:13:18,164
Ha.

208
00:13:18,187 --> 00:13:22,820
Tog‘ yaqinida juda yaxshi issiq buloq bor.

209
00:13:22,843 --> 00:13:25,743
Qiziqib ketyapman.

210
00:13:25,766 --> 00:13:28,433
Tezroq bormoqchiman.

211
00:13:28,456 --> 00:13:33,013
Unda, shu hafta oxirida boramiz.

212
00:13:33,036 --> 00:13:34,903
Ha.

213
00:13:34,926 --> 00:13:37,870
Iltimos, menga ham ayting.

214
00:13:37,893 --> 00:13:39,393
6-Sahna: Mevalarni tanlashning sirlari

215
00:13:39,393 --> 00:13:42,141
Xush kelibsiz!

216
00:13:42,164 --> 00:13:45,274
Meva olasizmi?

217
00:13:45,298 --> 00:13:50,398
Supermarket mevalari juda yangi ekan.

218
00:13:50,421 --> 00:13:52,454
Ha.

219
00:13:52,477 --> 00:13:57,510
Bugun olma va mandarin arzon.

220
00:13:57,533 --> 00:14:02,479
Olma va mandarin, qaysi biri shirinroq?

221
00:14:02,503 --> 00:14:07,742
Hozirgi mavsumda mandarin shirinroq.

222
00:14:07,765 --> 00:14:10,341
Shundaymi?

223
00:14:10,364 --> 00:14:13,598
Olma qanday?

224
00:14:13,622 --> 00:14:18,888
Olma bir oz nordon, lekin mazali.

225
00:14:18,911 --> 00:14:22,485
Qaysini tanlashim kerak, oylayapman.

226
00:14:22,509 --> 00:14:26,046
Sinab ko‘rish imkoniyati bor.

227
00:14:26,069 --> 00:14:28,536
Sinab ko‘ring.

228
00:14:28,559 --> 00:14:31,066
Rahmat.

229
00:14:31,089 --> 00:14:34,956
Avval olmani sinayman.

230
00:14:34,979 --> 00:14:37,158
Qanday?

231
00:14:37,181 --> 00:14:41,491
Qarsillab, juda mazali.

232
00:14:41,515 --> 00:14:45,615
Keyin mandarinni ham sinab ko‘ring.

233
00:14:45,638 --> 00:14:47,753
Ha.

234
00:14:47,776 --> 00:14:52,013
A, mandarin shirinroq ekan.

235
00:14:52,037 --> 00:14:54,504
Shunday, shunday.

236
00:14:54,527 --> 00:14:59,793
Mandarinning bu turi eng shirin.

237
00:14:59,816 --> 00:15:05,883
Ikkalasi ham mazali, lekin men mandarinni ko‘proq yaxshi ko‘raman.

238
00:15:05,906 --> 00:15:09,873
Mandarindan nechtasini olasiz?

239
00:15:09,896 --> 00:15:14,367
Oilam ham yeydi, shuning uchun ko‘p kerak.

240
00:15:14,390 --> 00:15:17,940
Bu paketda o‘n dona bor.

241
00:15:17,963 --> 00:15:20,663
Shuni olaman.

242
00:15:20,686 --> 00:15:23,123
Narxi qancha?

243
00:15:23,146 --> 00:15:26,079
Besh yuz so‘m.

244
00:15:26,102 --> 00:15:29,059
Banan ham bormi?

245
00:15:29,082 --> 00:15:31,049
Ha.

246
00:15:31,073 --> 00:15:33,458
U yerda bor.

247
00:15:33,482 --> 00:15:38,677
Mevalar orasida banan eng arzoni.

248
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:40,867
Ha.

249
00:15:40,890 --> 00:15:44,271
Har kuni yeyishga qulay.

250
00:15:44,294 --> 00:15:48,481
Unda, banan ham bir dasta olaman.

251
00:15:48,504 --> 00:15:51,171
Rahmat.

252
00:15:51,194 --> 00:15:54,977
Jami yetti yuz so‘m.

253
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,900
Ha.

254
00:15:56,923 --> 00:15:59,623
Ming so‘mdan.

255
00:15:59,646 --> 00:16:03,146
Uch yuz so‘m qaytim.

256
00:16:03,169 --> 00:16:05,737
Rahmat.

257
00:16:05,761 --> 00:16:08,307
Yana kelaman.

258
00:16:08,330 --> 00:16:11,034
Kutib qolamiz.

259
00:16:11,058 --> 00:16:12,558
7-Sahna: Sevimli va mohir sport turlari

260
00:16:12,558 --> 00:16:18,058
Yakshanba kuni televizorda sport ko‘rdingizmi?

261
00:16:18,081 --> 00:16:22,666
Ha, futbol o‘yinini ko‘rdim.

262
00:16:22,689 --> 00:16:26,022
Men beysbol ko‘rdim.

263
00:16:26,045 --> 00:16:29,181
Juda qiziqarli edi.

264
00:16:29,205 --> 00:16:34,082
Futbol va beysboldan qaysi birini yaxshi ko‘rasiz?

265
00:16:34,105 --> 00:16:38,338
Men beysbolni ko‘proq yaxshi ko‘raman.

266
00:16:38,361 --> 00:16:43,715
Men futbolni beysboldan ko‘ra ko‘proq yaxshi ko‘raman.

267
00:16:43,739 --> 00:16:46,272
Nega?

268
00:16:46,295 --> 00:16:52,328
Futbolda ko‘proq yugurishadi, shuning uchun zo‘r ko‘rinadi.

269
00:16:52,351 --> 00:16:54,658
Tushunarli.

270
00:16:54,682 --> 00:17:00,015
Beysbolda qoidalari biroz murakkabroq.

271
00:17:00,038 --> 00:17:02,371
Shunday.

272
00:17:02,394 --> 00:17:07,261
Men qoidalari yaxshi tushunmayman.

273
00:17:07,284 --> 00:17:11,856
Sport turlari orasida nima eng yaxshi ko‘rasiz?

274
00:17:11,879 --> 00:17:16,589
Men tennisni eng yaxshi ko‘raman.

275
00:17:16,612 --> 00:17:19,193
Tennismi?

276
00:17:19,217 --> 00:17:21,584
Yaxshi.

277
00:17:21,607 --> 00:17:26,540
Dam olish kunlarida bog‘da ko‘pincha tennis o‘ynayman.

278
00:17:26,563 --> 00:17:29,396
Kim bilan qilamiz?

279
00:17:29,419 --> 00:17:32,853
Ishdoshlarim bilan qilaman.

280
00:17:32,876 --> 00:17:35,785
Juda qiziqarli koʻrinadi.

281
00:17:35,808 --> 00:17:39,643
Men ham sport bilan shugʻullanmoqchiman.

282
00:17:39,667 --> 00:17:44,433
Unda, kelgusi safar birga tennis oʻynaymizmi?

283
00:17:44,456 --> 00:17:49,390
Men tennisda yomonman, lekin muammo yoʻqmi?

284
00:17:49,413 --> 00:17:52,046
Muammo yoʻq.

285
00:17:52,069 --> 00:17:55,302
Sekin-asta oʻrgataman.

286
00:17:55,325 --> 00:17:57,625
Iltimos.

287
00:17:57,648 --> 00:18:03,245
Sport bilan shugʻullanish uchun ertalabmi yoki tushdan keyinmi yaxshi?

288
00:18:03,269 --> 00:18:07,624
Ertalab havo salqinroq boʻladi.

289
00:18:07,647 --> 00:18:09,881
Tushunarli.

290
00:18:09,904 --> 00:18:14,204
Unda yakshanba kuni ertalab qilamiz.

291
00:18:14,227 --> 00:18:18,293
Kerakli jihozlar bormi?

292
00:18:18,316 --> 00:18:22,073
Raketka va poyabzalni ijaraga beraman.

293
00:18:22,097 --> 00:18:24,168
Juda yaxshi boʻladi.

294
00:18:24,191 --> 00:18:27,824
Ichimlik olib kelaman.

295
00:18:27,847 --> 00:18:29,921
Iltimos.

296
00:18:29,945 --> 00:18:33,330
Sport ichimligi yaxshi boʻladi.

297
00:18:33,354 --> 00:18:35,824
Tushunarli.

298
00:18:35,847 --> 00:18:38,280
Sotib olib kelaman.

299
00:18:38,303 --> 00:18:41,682
Yakshanba kunini intizorlik bilan kutaman.

300
00:18:41,706 --> 00:18:43,972
Ha.

301
00:18:43,995 --> 00:18:46,341
Harakat qilaman.

302
00:18:46,365 --> 00:18:47,865
Sahna 8: Kechki choy vaqti / Evening Tea Time

303
00:18:47,865 --> 00:18:52,498
Kechki ovqat juda mazali boʻldi, shunday emasmi?

304
00:18:52,521 --> 00:18:57,271
Ha, qorni toʻldi.

305
00:18:57,294 --> 00:19:00,234
Nimadir ichasizmi?

306
00:19:00,258 --> 00:19:03,358
Suv qaynataman.

307
00:19:03,381 --> 00:19:05,921
Iltimos.

308
00:19:05,945 --> 00:19:10,338
Qahva yoki choy, qaysi birini xohlaysiz?

309
00:19:10,361 --> 00:19:16,230
Hmm, kechki payt choy yaxshi boʻladi.

310
00:19:16,253 --> 00:19:20,222
Qahva ichsangiz uxlay olmaysizmi?

311
00:19:20,246 --> 00:19:25,236
Ha, qahva ertalab yaxshi boʻladi.

312
00:19:25,259 --> 00:19:27,367
Tushunarli.

313
00:19:27,391 --> 00:19:30,059
Choy tayyorlayman.

314
00:19:30,082 --> 00:19:34,349
Shakar va sut bormi?

315
00:19:34,372 --> 00:19:37,039
Ha, bor.

316
00:19:37,062 --> 00:19:39,615
Ikkalasi ham solaymi?

317
00:19:39,638 --> 00:19:43,622
Menga faqat sut soling.

318
00:19:43,646 --> 00:19:46,679
Ha, iltimos.

319
00:19:46,702 --> 00:19:50,069
Issiq, ehtiyot boʻling.

320
00:19:50,092 --> 00:19:52,625
Rahmat.

321
00:19:52,648 --> 00:19:55,548
Juda yaxshi hid kelmoqda.

322
00:19:55,572 --> 00:20:00,325
Bu choy sovgʻa sifatida berilgan edi.

323
00:20:00,349 --> 00:20:03,545
Qaysi davlatdan sovgʻa?

324
00:20:03,568 --> 00:20:06,274
Angliyadan.

325
00:20:06,297 --> 00:20:10,197
Angliya choyi bilan mashhur, shundaymi?

326
00:20:10,220 --> 00:20:13,412
Juda mazali.

327
00:20:13,435 --> 00:20:18,469
Mening mamlakatimdagi choydan ham xushboʻyroq.

328
00:20:18,492 --> 00:20:20,967
Bu juda yaxshi.

329
00:20:20,990 --> 00:20:24,094
Pechene ham bor.

330
00:20:24,118 --> 00:20:27,185
Vaa, juda xursand boʻldim!

331
00:20:27,208 --> 00:20:29,508
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

332
00:20:29,531 --> 00:20:34,441
Ichimliklardan qaysi biri eng yoqadi?

333
00:20:34,464 --> 00:20:38,797
Menga choy eng yoqadi.

334
00:20:38,820 --> 00:20:41,854
Yapon yashil choyimi?

335
00:20:41,877 --> 00:20:47,543
Ha, shirin shirinliklar bilan yashil choy juda mos keladi.

336
00:20:47,566 --> 00:20:49,718
Shunday.

337
00:20:49,742 --> 00:20:53,575
Men ham yashil choy juda yaxshi koʻraman.

338
00:20:53,598 --> 00:20:58,232
Shu yaqinlarda mazali choyxona bor, boramizmi?

339
00:20:58,255 --> 00:21:01,155
Yaxshi.

340
00:21:01,178 --> 00:21:05,244
Stansiya yaqinida yangi choyxona ochilgan.

341
00:21:05,267 --> 00:21:07,901
Qachon boramiz?

342
00:21:07,924 --> 00:21:11,492
Shu hafta shanba kuni qanday?

343
00:21:11,515 --> 00:21:14,790
Ha, vaqtim bor.

344
00:21:14,814 --> 00:21:17,281
Boraylik!

345
00:21:17,304 --> 00:21:19,937
Juda kutaman!

346
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:21,460
Sahna 9: Uy hayvonlari / Sevimli uy hayvonlari: Itlar va mushuklar

347
00:21:21,460 --> 00:21:24,037
Qarang.

348
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:28,775
Ana u it juda yoqimli ekan, shundaymi?

349
00:21:28,798 --> 00:21:31,665
Rostdan ham.

350
00:21:31,688 --> 00:21:35,321
Juda sergak va tez yuguradi.

351
00:21:35,344 --> 00:21:39,731
Sizda uy hayvoni bormi?

352
00:21:39,755 --> 00:21:42,055
Ha.

353
00:21:42,078 --> 00:21:46,211
Mening uyimda ikkita mushuk bor.

354
00:21:46,234 --> 00:21:48,807
Yaxshi.

355
00:21:48,831 --> 00:21:53,364
It va mushukdan qaysi biri yoqadi?

356
00:21:53,387 --> 00:21:57,655
Men mushuklarni koʻproq yaxshi koʻraman.

357
00:21:57,679 --> 00:22:00,412
Nega?

358
00:22:00,435 --> 00:22:07,582
Mushuklar tinchroq boʻladi. Itlar biroz shovqinliroq.

359
00:22:07,605 --> 00:22:12,272
Men itlarni mushuklarga qaraganda koʻproq yaxshi koʻraman.

360
00:22:12,295 --> 00:22:16,562
Itlar bilan birga oʻynash mumkin, shundaymi?

361
00:22:16,585 --> 00:22:18,493
Ha.

362
00:22:18,517 --> 00:22:22,750
Har ertalab itim bilan sayr qilamiz.

363
00:22:22,773 --> 00:22:26,673
Itlarga sayr qilish kerak.

364
00:22:26,696 --> 00:22:29,862
Mushuklarga sayr qilish shart emas.

365
00:22:29,886 --> 00:22:33,273
Qaysi biri parvarish qilish osonroq?

366
00:22:33,296 --> 00:22:37,529
Mushuklarni parvarish qilish osonroq deb oʻylayman.

367
00:22:37,552 --> 00:22:42,220
Men katta it boqmoqchiman.

368
00:22:42,244 --> 00:22:49,828
Katta itlar kichik itlarga qaraganda koʻproq ovqat yeydi.

369
00:22:49,851 --> 00:22:53,830
Koʻp pul ketadi.

370
00:22:53,854 --> 00:22:58,687
Hayvonlar ichida qaysi biri eng yoqadi?

371
00:22:58,710 --> 00:23:03,424
Menga otlar eng yoqadi.

372
00:23:03,447 --> 00:23:05,947
Otlarmi?

373
00:23:05,970 --> 00:23:09,103
Ot minishni bilasizmi?

374
00:23:09,126 --> 00:23:11,226
Ha.

375
00:23:11,249 --> 00:23:14,719
Bolaligimda oʻrganganman.

376
00:23:14,742 --> 00:23:17,576
Juda zoʻr!

377
00:23:17,599 --> 00:23:21,499
Menga quyonlar yoqadi.

378
00:23:21,522 --> 00:23:24,630
Quyonlar ham juda yoqimli.

379
00:23:24,654 --> 00:23:26,931
Ha.

380
00:23:26,954 --> 00:23:30,987
Kichkina va yumshoq.

381
00:23:31,010 --> 00:23:35,189
Shu yaqinlarda hayvonot bogʻiga boramizmi?

382
00:23:35,213 --> 00:23:37,754
Yaxshi.

383
00:23:37,777 --> 00:23:41,610
Koʻp hayvonlarni koʻrmoqchiman.

384
00:23:41,633 --> 00:23:45,567
Pandalar eng mashhuri.

385
00:23:45,590 --> 00:23:48,456
Albatta koʻrmoqchiman!

386
00:23:48,479 --> 00:23:51,819
Koʻp suratga tushamiz.

387
00:23:51,843 --> 00:23:56,395
Keyingi hafta yakshanba kuni boramiz.

388
00:23:56,418 --> 00:23:58,690
Ha.

389
00:23:58,714 --> 00:24:01,947
Ovqat olib kelaman.

390
00:24:01,970 --> 00:24:04,804
Rahmat.

391
00:24:04,827 --> 00:24:06,327
Sahna 10: Yozgi taʼtil manzili / Yozgi taʼtil uchun joy tanlash

392
00:24:06,327 --> 00:24:10,325
Tez orada yozgi taʼtil boshlanadi, shundaymi?

393
00:24:10,349 --> 00:24:12,182
Ha.

394
00:24:12,205 --> 00:24:15,838
Qayerga sayohat qilmoqchisiz?

395
00:24:15,861 --> 00:24:19,161
Hali aniqlamaganman.

396
00:24:19,184 --> 00:24:21,818
Ikki xil joy orasida ikkilanmoqdaman.

397
00:24:21,841 --> 00:24:26,280
Dengiz va togʻdan qaysi birini afzal koʻrasiz?

398
00:24:26,303 --> 00:24:30,499
Menga dengiz yaxshiroq.

399
00:24:30,523 --> 00:24:33,756
Dengizda nima qilmoqchisiz?

400
00:24:33,779 --> 00:24:36,846
Suzmoqchiman.

401
00:24:36,869 --> 00:24:40,805
Keyin baliq yeyishni xohlardim.

402
00:24:40,828 --> 00:24:45,585
Men dengizga qaraganda togʻlarni koʻproq yaxshi koʻraman.

403
00:24:45,609 --> 00:24:48,126
Nega?

404
00:24:48,149 --> 00:24:52,103
Togʻlar ancha salqinroq boʻladi-ku.

405
00:24:52,127 --> 00:24:54,794
Shunday.

406
00:24:54,817 --> 00:24:59,350
Yozda dengiz juda issiq boʻladi.

407
00:24:59,373 --> 00:25:04,089
Togʻda lager qilish eng qiziqarli narsa!

408
00:25:04,112 --> 00:25:06,612
Lager qilishmi?

409
00:25:06,635 --> 00:25:08,943
Yaxshi.

410
00:25:08,966 --> 00:25:12,701
Tunda yulduzlar juda chiroyli koʻrinadi.

411
00:25:12,725 --> 00:25:17,191
Ammo hasharotlar koʻp ekan, shundaymi?

412
00:25:17,214 --> 00:25:19,348
Ha.

413
00:25:19,371 --> 00:25:24,337
Dengiz va togʻ, qaysi birida hasharotlar koʻproq?

414
00:25:24,360 --> 00:25:28,294
Togʻlarda koʻproq deb oʻylayman.

415
00:25:28,317 --> 00:25:31,794
Bunday boʻlishi mumkin.

416
00:25:31,817 --> 00:25:37,789
Yaponiyaga sayohatingiz davomida eng yaxshi joy qayer boʻldi?

417
00:25:37,813 --> 00:25:42,880
Menga Xokkaydo eng yoqdi.

418
00:25:42,903 --> 00:25:47,136
Xokkaydoda ovqatlar juda mazali, shunday emasmi?

419
00:25:47,159 --> 00:25:49,493
Ha.

420
00:25:49,515 --> 00:25:52,873
Dengiz mahsulotlari donburi eng zoʻri edi!

421
00:25:52,897 --> 00:25:57,281
Men ham Xokkaydoga borishni xohlayman.

422
00:25:57,304 --> 00:26:00,204
Samolyotda bordingizmi?

423
00:26:00,227 --> 00:26:02,661
Ha.

424
00:26:02,684 --> 00:26:07,265
Samolyot shinkansendan tezroq boʻladi-ku.

425
00:26:07,288 --> 00:26:11,430
Samolyot chiptasi qancha turadi?

426
00:26:11,454 --> 00:26:16,320
Yozgi taʼtilda chiptalar qimmat boʻladi.

427
00:26:16,343 --> 00:26:20,727
Shinkansen va samolyot, qaysi biri qimmatroq?

428
00:26:20,751 --> 00:26:25,457
Ehtimol, samolyot qimmatroqdir.

429
00:26:25,481 --> 00:26:27,781
Tushunarli.

430
00:26:27,804 --> 00:26:31,147
Biroz oʻylab koʻrayapman.

431
00:26:31,170 --> 00:26:34,870
Yozgi taʼtilingiz qiziqarli oʻtishini tilayman!

432
00:26:34,893 --> 00:26:37,669
Ha. Rahmat.

433
00:26:47,700 --> 00:26:49,200
11-Sahna: Koʻchish va yangi kvartiraning qulayligi

434
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:53,136
Koʻchib oʻtishdan charchadingizmi? Rahmat.

435
00:26:53,159 --> 00:26:55,477
Rahmat.

436
00:26:55,500 --> 00:27:00,167
Nihoyat, barcha yuklarni joylashtirdingizmi?

437
00:27:00,190 --> 00:27:04,490
Ha, kecha hammasi tugadi.

438
00:27:04,513 --> 00:27:08,046
Yangi kvartira qanday?

439
00:27:08,069 --> 00:27:13,569
Hozirgi kvartira oldingisiga qaraganda kichikroq.

440
00:27:13,592 --> 00:27:16,459
Shundaymi?

441
00:27:16,482 --> 00:27:21,415
Ha, keraksiz narsalarni koʻp tashladim.

442
00:27:21,438 --> 00:27:26,305
Kvartira kichikroq boʻlib, noqulay emasmi?

443
00:27:26,328 --> 00:27:31,661
Yoʻq. Oldingi kvartiraga qaraganda stansiyaga yaqinroq.

444
00:27:31,684 --> 00:27:35,517
Piyoda necha daqiqa ketadi?

445
00:27:35,540 --> 00:27:39,290
Piyoda besh daqiqa atrofida.

446
00:27:39,314 --> 00:27:42,547
Bu juda qulay ekan!

447
00:27:42,570 --> 00:27:48,604
Ha, har kuni ishlashga borish ancha oson boʻldi.

448
00:27:48,627 --> 00:27:52,693
Boshqa yaxshilangan tomonlari bormi?

449
00:27:52,716 --> 00:27:57,707
Derazalar katta boʻlgani uchun, xona yorqinroq boʻldi.

450
00:27:57,731 --> 00:28:01,276
Bu ajoyib ekan!

451
00:28:01,299 --> 00:28:06,046
Oldingi xona har doim qorongʻi edi.

452
00:28:06,070 --> 00:28:09,703
Yaqin atrofda supermarket bormi?

453
00:28:09,726 --> 00:28:14,042
Stansiya oldida katta supermarket bor.

454
00:28:14,066 --> 00:28:17,966
Xarid qilish ham qulay ekan.

455
00:28:17,989 --> 00:28:23,489
Ha, har kuni yangi sabzavotlar sotib olish mumkin.

456
00:28:23,512 --> 00:28:27,645
Pishirish endi qiziqarli boʻladi, shundaymi?

457
00:28:27,668 --> 00:28:33,101
Ha. Dam olish kunlarida oʻz-oʻzim pishira boshladim.

458
00:28:33,124 --> 00:28:38,291
Kelajakda yangi kvartirangizga tashrif buyurishim mumkinmi?

459
00:28:38,314 --> 00:28:42,547
Albatta. Iltimos, keling.

460
00:28:42,570 --> 00:28:46,712
Shirin tort olib ketaman.

461
00:28:46,736 --> 00:28:49,519
Kutib turibman.

462
00:28:49,542 --> 00:28:53,309
Kelgusi yakshanba qanday?

463
00:28:53,332 --> 00:28:57,448
Ha. Tushdan keyin kelaman.

464
00:28:57,472 --> 00:29:01,150
Stansiyaga yetib kelganimda qo’ng’iroq qilaman.

465
00:29:01,173 --> 00:29:02,673
12-SAHNA: Mashqning foydalari va uni davom ettirish usullari

466
00:29:02,673 --> 00:29:07,739
Yaqinda biror sport bilan shug’ullanyapsizmi?

467
00:29:07,762 --> 00:29:10,911
Umuman emas.

468
00:29:10,935 --> 00:29:14,471
Mashq qilish yaxshi bo’ladi-ku.

469
00:29:14,494 --> 00:29:16,963
Shunday.

470
00:29:16,987 --> 00:29:20,738
Yaqinda ozgina semirdim.

471
00:29:20,761 --> 00:29:26,502
Men har kuni uy yaqinidan sayr qilaman.

472
00:29:26,526 --> 00:29:28,885
Sayr qilishmi?

473
00:29:28,908 --> 00:29:31,146
Ha.

474
00:29:31,170 --> 00:29:35,315
Har ertalab yarim soat atrofida yuraman.

475
00:29:35,339 --> 00:29:39,005
Jogging qilish yaxshiroq emasmi?

476
00:29:39,028 --> 00:29:44,895
Sayr qilish ham jogging bilan deyarli bir xil samarali.

477
00:29:44,918 --> 00:29:47,784
Rostdanmi?

478
00:29:47,807 --> 00:29:50,592
Bilmagandim.

479
00:29:50,616 --> 00:29:52,250
Ha.

480
00:29:52,273 --> 00:29:56,573
Asosiy shart – zo’r bermaslik.

481
00:29:56,596 --> 00:29:59,380
Rostdan ham.

482
00:29:59,403 --> 00:30:05,337
Yugurishdan koʻra, sayr qilishni uzoqroq davom ettirish mumkin.

483
00:30:05,360 --> 00:30:10,072
Unda men ham qila olaman.

484
00:30:10,095 --> 00:30:13,395
Iltimos, boshlang.

485
00:30:13,418 --> 00:30:16,605
Tana yengillashadi.

486
00:30:16,629 --> 00:30:20,862
Ertaga ertalabdan boshlab sayr qilaman.

487
00:30:20,885 --> 00:30:24,798
Sport poyabzalingiz bormi?

488
00:30:24,822 --> 00:30:28,255
Oddiy poyabzalim bor.

489
00:30:28,278 --> 00:30:32,234
Oyoqlaringiz og’rishi mumkin.

490
00:30:32,257 --> 00:30:36,010
Sport poyabzali olish kerak.

491
00:30:36,033 --> 00:30:40,575
Bugun ishdan keyin sotib olamizmi?

492
00:30:40,599 --> 00:30:42,638
Ha.

493
00:30:42,662 --> 00:30:47,132
Yengil va yurishga qulay poyabzal izlaymiz.

494
00:30:47,155 --> 00:30:51,122
Yaxshi poyabzal topishingizga umid qilamiz.

495
00:30:51,145 --> 00:30:53,417
Rahmat.

496
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:56,506
Ertadan boshlab harakat qilaman.

497
00:30:56,529 --> 00:31:00,364
Birgalikda sog’lom bo’lamiz.

498
00:31:00,388 --> 00:31:06,262
Sayr qilishga ko’nikib olgandan keyin tog’ga sayr qilishga bormaymizmi?

499
00:31:06,286 --> 00:31:08,626
Yaxshi.

500
00:31:08,649 --> 00:31:11,549
Juda kutaman.

501
00:31:11,572 --> 00:31:16,105
Avval bir oy davom ettiraman.

502
00:31:16,128 --> 00:31:19,062
Sizni qo’llab-quvvatlayman.

503
00:31:19,085 --> 00:31:20,585
13-SAHNA: Smartfonni almashtirish haqidagi ikkilanish

504
00:31:20,585 --> 00:31:26,579
Smartfonni almashtirish kerakmi, deb ikkilanmoqdaman.

505
00:31:26,602 --> 00:31:30,702
Joriy smartfongiz eskiroqmi?

506
00:31:30,725 --> 00:31:36,258
Ha, uch yildan beri foydalanmoqdaman.

507
00:31:36,281 --> 00:31:43,189
Yangi modelda kamera eski modelga qaraganda yaxshiroq.

508
00:31:43,213 --> 00:31:48,724
Ha, suratlar ancha chiroyli chiqadi.

509
00:31:48,748 --> 00:31:53,857
Joriy smartfongizning holati yomonmi?

510
00:31:53,880 --> 00:32:01,580
Joriy smartfonim yangi modeldek qulay emas.

511
00:32:01,603 --> 00:32:05,752
Batareyka tez tugaydimi?

512
00:32:05,775 --> 00:32:12,454
Ha, kuniga ikki marta zaryad qilish kerak.

513
00:32:12,478 --> 00:32:16,311
Bu juda qiyin boʻlsa kerak.

514
00:32:16,334 --> 00:32:24,034
Ekran ham chiroyli, surat ham chiroyli, yangi smartfon istayapman.

515
00:32:24,057 --> 00:32:28,795
Ammo yangi smartfon qimmat.

516
00:32:28,819 --> 00:32:35,386
Ha, biroz arzonroq bo’lsa deb o’ylayapman.

517
00:32:35,409 --> 00:32:41,326
Hozirgi telefon bilan ham uncha noqulay emasdir.

518
00:32:41,349 --> 00:32:46,282
Faqat qo'ng'iroq va xabarlar uchun yetarli.

519
00:32:46,305 --> 00:32:49,172
O'yinlar bilan shug'ullanasizmi?

520
00:32:49,195 --> 00:32:55,232
Ha, har kuni taxminan bir soat o'yin o'ynayman.

521
00:32:55,255 --> 00:33:01,755
Unda yaxshi ishlaydigan smartfon sotib olish yaxshiroq.

522
00:33:01,778 --> 00:33:06,612
Dam olish kunida elektr do'koniga borishni o'ylayapman.

523
00:33:06,634 --> 00:33:10,468
Men ham siz bilan birga borsam bo'ladimi?

524
00:33:10,491 --> 00:33:14,424
Albatta, birga qaraymiz.

525
00:33:14,447 --> 00:33:19,992
Yaqinda chiqadigan smartfonlar ranglari ham juda ko'p ekan.

526
00:33:20,015 --> 00:33:24,549
Men ko'k rangli smartfon izlayapman.

527
00:33:24,572 --> 00:33:29,356
Qopqog'ini ham birga sotib olish kerak.

528
00:33:29,379 --> 00:33:34,882
Elektr do'koni yonida aksessuarlar do'koni bor.

529
00:33:34,906 --> 00:33:38,498
Unda u yerga ham boramiz.

530
00:33:38,521 --> 00:33:42,878
Shu hafta shanba kuni tushdan keyin bo'ladimi?

531
00:33:42,901 --> 00:33:48,291
Ha, vokzal oldida uchrashamiz.

532
00:33:48,314 --> 00:33:51,624
Iltimos, menga ham ayting.

533
00:33:51,648 --> 00:33:53,148
14-Sahna: Sayohat rejalari va joy tanlash / Sayohat rejalashtirish va manzillar tanlash

534
00:33:53,148 --> 00:33:58,248
Dam olish kunlari sayohat haqida maslahatlashamiz.

535
00:33:58,271 --> 00:34:00,465
Yaxshi.

536
00:34:00,489 --> 00:34:03,756
Qayerga boramiz?

537
00:34:03,778 --> 00:34:09,212
Kiotoga yoki Osakaga borishni xohlaysizmi?

538
00:34:09,235 --> 00:34:13,868
Men Kiotoga borishni afzal ko'raman.

539
00:34:13,891 --> 00:34:16,358
Nega?

540
00:34:16,381 --> 00:34:21,314
Chunki qadimiy ibodatxonalar va ziyoratgohlarni ko'rmoqchiman.

541
00:34:21,337 --> 00:34:26,104
Kioto manzarasi juda go'zal ekan.

542
00:34:26,127 --> 00:34:30,960
Ha, ko'p rasmga tushmoqchiman.

543
00:34:30,983 --> 00:34:35,934
Men ko'p mazali taomlar yeyishni xohlayman.

544
00:34:35,957 --> 00:34:41,624
Osakaga borsangiz, juda ko'p mazali taomlar yeyish mumkin.

545
00:34:41,647 --> 00:34:45,965
Takoyaki va okonomiyaki juda mashhur ekan.

546
00:34:45,988 --> 00:34:52,501
Ha, Osaka juda gavjum va qiziqarli shahar.

547
00:34:52,525 --> 00:34:58,297
Osakadan Kiotogacha poyezdda qancha vaqt ketadi?

548
00:34:58,320 --> 00:35:02,554
Poyezdda taxminan 30 daqiqa.

549
00:35:02,577 --> 00:35:06,967
Unda ikkala joyga ham borishimiz mumkin ekan.

550
00:35:06,990 --> 00:35:13,124
Ha. Mehmonxonani Osakada bron qilish yaxshiroq.

551
00:35:13,147 --> 00:35:15,580
Nega?

552
00:35:15,603 --> 00:35:20,903
Chunki kechgacha o'ynash mumkin va arzonroq ham.

553
00:35:20,926 --> 00:35:24,042
Bu juda yaxshi fikr ekan.

554
00:35:24,066 --> 00:35:30,569
Kunduzlari Kiotoda sayohat qilib, kechqurun Osakada ovqatlanamiz.

555
00:35:30,592 --> 00:35:35,382
Ajoyib! Darhol ketishni xohlayapman.

556
00:35:35,406 --> 00:35:40,443
Bugun kechqurun internet orqali mehmonxonani bron qilaman.

557
00:35:40,466 --> 00:35:45,333
Iltimos. Pulni yarmini to'layman.

558
00:35:45,356 --> 00:35:50,554
Tushunarli. Shinkansen chiptalarini ham oldindan sotib olaman.

559
00:35:50,577 --> 00:35:55,371
Rahmat. Sayohatga tayyorgarlik ko'rayapman.

560
00:35:55,394 --> 00:35:58,364
Ob-havo yaxshi bo'lsa yaxshi bo'lardi.

561
00:35:58,388 --> 00:36:01,931
Nima sovg'a olishni o'ylaysiz?

562
00:36:01,955 --> 00:36:06,021
Men yapon shirinliklari sotib olishni niyat qilmoqdaman.

563
00:36:06,044 --> 00:36:08,911
Men ham shunday qilaman.

564
00:36:08,935 --> 00:36:10,435
15-Sahna: Yapon tilini yaxshilashning sirlari / Yapon tilini yaxshilash uchun maslahatlar

565
00:36:10,435 --> 00:36:15,469
Yaqinda yapon tilini o'rganish qanday?

566
00:36:15,492 --> 00:36:19,192
Har kuni harakat qilaman.

567
00:36:19,215 --> 00:36:24,148
Yarim yil oldiniga nisbatan yapon tilim yaxshilandi.

568
00:36:24,171 --> 00:36:26,968
Rahmat.

569
00:36:26,992 --> 00:36:30,093
Bu juda xursandchilik.

570
00:36:30,116 --> 00:36:34,351
Ko'p suhbat mashqlari qildingizmi?

571
00:36:34,375 --> 00:36:36,609
Ha.

572
00:36:36,632 --> 00:36:41,265
Yapon do'stlarim bilan gaplashishga harakat qilaman.

573
00:36:41,289 --> 00:36:45,555
Aynan shu eng yaxshi mashq bo'ladi.

574
00:36:45,578 --> 00:36:51,012
Ammo, iyerogliflar grammatikaga qaraganda oson emas.

575
00:36:51,035 --> 00:36:55,604
Iyerogliflarni yodlash qiyin, shunday emasmi?

576
00:36:55,627 --> 00:36:57,984
Ha.

577
00:36:58,008 --> 00:37:03,308
Oʻqiy olsangiz ham, tez unutib qoʻyaverasiz.

578
00:37:03,331 --> 00:37:07,565
Koʻp yozish mashqlarini qilish kerak.

579
00:37:07,588 --> 00:37:09,821
Ha.

580
00:37:09,844 --> 00:37:13,818
Har kuni daftarga yozishni boshlayman.

581
00:37:13,841 --> 00:37:17,620
Televizordagi yangiliklarni tushunasizmi?

582
00:37:17,644 --> 00:37:21,024
Hali qiyin.

583
00:37:21,047 --> 00:37:25,435
Tez orada yangiliklarni oʻqiy olsangiz yaxshi boʻlardi.

584
00:37:25,459 --> 00:37:27,592
Ha.

585
00:37:27,615 --> 00:37:31,715
Lugʻatsiz oʻqiy oladigan boʻlaman.

586
00:37:31,738 --> 00:37:36,038
Anime tomosha qilish ham foydali boʻladi.

587
00:37:36,061 --> 00:37:40,961
Anime yaponchasi biroz tez emasmi?

588
00:37:40,984 --> 00:37:46,684
Tez, lekin kundalik suhbatda yordam beradi.

589
00:37:46,707 --> 00:37:51,304
Dam olish kunlarida yapon anime tomosha qilib koʻraman.

590
00:37:51,328 --> 00:37:55,294
Qiziqarli anime koʻp.

591
00:37:55,317 --> 00:38:00,351
Nomaʼlum soʻzlarni darhol izlab topaman.

592
00:38:00,374 --> 00:38:05,951
Bundan buyon har kuni oz-ozdan davom ettiring.

593
00:38:05,974 --> 00:38:08,141
Ha.

594
00:38:08,164 --> 00:38:11,708
Qishki imtihondan oʻtmoqchiman.

595
00:38:11,732 --> 00:38:15,499
N4 imtihoni, shundaymi?

596
00:38:15,522 --> 00:38:18,155
Sizni qo’llab-quvvatlayman.

597
00:38:18,178 --> 00:38:23,511
Nomaʼlum savollar boʻlsa, yana savol berishim mumkinmi?

598
00:38:23,534 --> 00:38:26,128
Albatta.

599
00:38:26,152 --> 00:38:29,219
Birga oʻrganamiz.

600
00:38:29,242 --> 00:38:32,343
Iltimos, menga ham ayting.

601
00:38:32,367 --> 00:38:33,867
16-Sahna: Teleishning yaxshi va yomon tomonlari

602
00:38:33,867 --> 00:38:38,235
Yaqinda koʻproq teleish qilasizmi?

603
00:38:38,258 --> 00:38:43,837
Ha, haftada uch kun uyda ishlayman.

604
00:38:43,860 --> 00:38:48,494
Ofisga chiqish va teleish, qaysi biri yoqadi?

605
00:38:48,517 --> 00:38:53,017
Menga teleish yoqadi.

606
00:38:53,040 --> 00:38:58,540
Yoʻlga chiqmaslik, ertalab uxlash yaxshi, shunday emasmi?

607
00:38:58,562 --> 00:39:03,503
Ha, har ertalab poyezd juda charchatar edi.

608
00:39:03,527 --> 00:39:08,234
Ofisga chiqish kunlari har doim charchab qolaman.

609
00:39:08,258 --> 00:39:13,610
Uyda konsentratsiya qila olmaysizmi?

610
00:39:13,633 --> 00:39:19,008
Menga uyda tinchroq va konsentratsiya qilish osonroq.

611
00:39:19,032 --> 00:39:25,098
Menga teleish ofisga qaraganda maslahat olish oson emasdek tuyuladi.

612
00:39:25,121 --> 00:39:30,855
Ofisda yonidagi odamga darhol savol berish mumkin.

613
00:39:30,878 --> 00:39:36,511
Ha, nomaʼlum narsalarni elektron pochta orqali soʻrash vaqt oladi.

614
00:39:36,534 --> 00:39:40,101
Onlayn yigʻilishlar qanday?

615
00:39:40,124 --> 00:39:45,558
Ovoz eshitilmay qoladi yoki ekran muzlaydi.

616
00:39:45,581 --> 00:39:50,752
Shuning uchun yigʻilish kunlarida ofisga chiqish yaxshiroq.

617
00:39:50,776 --> 00:39:56,080
Mening kompaniyamda hali teleish mumkin emas.

618
00:39:56,103 --> 00:39:58,851
Bu juda qiyin boʻlsa kerak.

619
00:39:58,875 --> 00:40:01,751
Har doim ofisga chiqasizmi?

620
00:40:01,774 --> 00:40:07,208
Ha, har kuni bir soat poyezdda oʻtiraman.

621
00:40:07,231 --> 00:40:11,864
Rahbaringiz bilan teleish haqida maslahatlashib koʻrsangiz?

622
00:40:11,887 --> 00:40:14,189
Shunday.

623
00:40:14,213 --> 00:40:16,846
Navbatda aytib koʻraman.

624
00:40:16,869 --> 00:40:22,342
Teleish kunlarida tushlikni oʻzingiz pishirishingiz mumkin.

625
00:40:22,366 --> 00:40:26,600
Tashqarida ovqatlanish kamaysa, pul ham tejaydigan boʻladi.

626
00:40:26,623 --> 00:40:30,895
Teleishni yanada havas qilib qoʻydingiz.

627
00:40:30,918 --> 00:40:38,551
Kelgusi yilda ish uslubi asta-sekin oʻzgarishi mumkin. Buning boʻlishini tilayman.

628
00:40:38,574 --> 00:40:42,641
Bugungi ishdan keyin birga ichishga chiqmaymizmi?

629
00:40:42,663 --> 00:40:44,897
Yaxshi.

630
00:40:44,920 --> 00:40:48,256
Mazali pivo ichishni xohlayman.

631
00:40:48,279 --> 00:40:52,013
Bekat yaqinidagi izakayaga boring.

632
00:40:52,036 --> 00:40:53,536
17-Sahna: Filmlar va manga solishtiruvi

633
00:40:53,536 --> 00:40:59,636
Film tugadi, shunday emasmi?

634
00:40:59,658 --> 00:41:02,492
Juda ham hayajonli va qiziqarli edi.

635
00:41:02,515 --> 00:41:06,615
Aksion sahnalari ajoyib edi, shunday emasmi?

636
00:41:06,638 --> 00:41:10,671
Asl komiksni o‘qidingizmi?

637
00:41:10,694 --> 00:41:12,676
Ha.

638
00:41:12,700 --> 00:41:17,255
Film komiksdek batafsil emas ekan.

639
00:41:17,278 --> 00:41:22,011
Bir necha muhim sahnalar yo‘q edi.

640
00:41:22,034 --> 00:41:27,567
Vaqti ikki soatgina, shuning uchun qilmaymiz.

641
00:41:27,590 --> 00:41:32,624
Hayajon komiksdagidan ko‘ra filmda ko‘proq.

642
00:41:32,647 --> 00:41:38,613
Katta ekranda ko‘rish imkoniyatiga ega bo‘lib, juda yaxshi bo‘ldi.

643
00:41:38,636 --> 00:41:42,803
Televizorda ko‘rishdan ancha ta’sirliroq.

644
00:41:42,827 --> 00:41:47,660
Musiqa ham tasvirlar kabi ajoyib edi.

645
00:41:47,683 --> 00:41:52,155
Yangi qahramonlarning ovozi ham mos tushgan.

646
00:41:52,179 --> 00:41:56,812
Keyingi filmni ham kinoteatrda ko‘rmoqchiman.

647
00:41:56,835 --> 00:42:02,215
Davomi kelasi yil yozda chiqadi ekan.

648
00:42:02,239 --> 00:42:06,431
Bir yil kutishimiz kerakmi?

649
00:42:06,455 --> 00:42:09,155
Uzoq ekan-ku.

650
00:42:09,178 --> 00:42:13,734
Shu vaqtgacha komiksni yana bir bor o‘qib chiqaman.

651
00:42:13,757 --> 00:42:18,498
Men ham barcha jildlarni qayta o‘qishni o‘ylayapman.

652
00:42:18,522 --> 00:42:22,904
Do‘stlar bilan taassurotlarni baham ko‘rish juda qiziqarli.

653
00:42:22,928 --> 00:42:24,927
Ha.

654
00:42:24,950 --> 00:42:28,617
Qorni ochdi, shunday emasmi?

655
00:42:28,640 --> 00:42:31,913
Kechki ovqatga chiqmaymizmi?

656
00:42:31,936 --> 00:42:36,456
Gamburger yoki omletli guruch (omuraisu) yeymoqchiman.

657
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:41,437
Shu burchakda mazali Yevropa taomlari restorani bor.

658
00:42:41,460 --> 00:42:44,250
Shu yerga boring.

659
00:42:44,274 --> 00:42:49,423
Kinoga chipta ko‘rsatilsa, sharbat bepul bo‘ladi.

660
00:42:49,446 --> 00:42:52,980
Bu juda yoqimli xizmat ekan.

661
00:42:53,004 --> 00:42:55,637
Boraylik!

662
00:42:55,660 --> 00:42:59,378
Film haqidagi suhbatni davom ettiramiz.

663
00:42:59,401 --> 00:43:01,268
Ha.

664
00:43:01,291 --> 00:43:04,635
Yurib ketayotganimizda gaplashamiz.

665
00:43:04,659 --> 00:43:06,159
18-SAHNA: Uyda ovqat pishirishning afzalliklari

666
00:43:06,159 --> 00:43:11,477
Har kuni tushlikni qanday yeysiz?

667
00:43:11,500 --> 00:43:18,200
Men har doim do‘kondan tayyor ovqat sotib olaman.

668
00:43:18,223 --> 00:43:24,365
Men har doim o‘zim pishirgan tushlikni olib boraman.

669
00:43:24,389 --> 00:43:28,255
Uyda ovqat pishirasizmi?

670
00:43:28,278 --> 00:43:30,812
Ajoyib!

671
00:43:30,835 --> 00:43:36,968
Pishirishni yaxshi ko‘raman, shuning uchun umuman qiynalmayman.

672
00:43:36,991 --> 00:43:42,169
Tashqarida ovqatlanish va uyda pishirish, qaysi biri foydaliroq?

673
00:43:42,192 --> 00:43:48,136
Uyda pishirish arzonroq va sog‘lomroq.

674
00:43:48,160 --> 00:43:53,026
Men ham biroz pul tejamoqchiman.

675
00:43:53,049 --> 00:43:58,632
Shunda albatta uyda ovqat pishirishingiz kerak.

676
00:43:58,656 --> 00:44:03,291
Yaqinda sabzavotlar qimmatlashdi, shunday emasmi?

677
00:44:03,314 --> 00:44:10,300
Ha, lekin tashqarida ovqatlanishda uyda pishirishdek sabzavot yeyolmaymiz.

678
00:44:10,324 --> 00:44:15,991
Do‘konlardagi tayyor ovqatda sabzavot kam bo‘ladi.

679
00:44:16,014 --> 00:44:21,916
O‘zingiz pishirsangiz, ko‘p sabzavot yeyishingiz mumkin.

680
00:44:21,939 --> 00:44:28,125
Uyda ovqat pishirganda idish-tovoq yuvish zerikarli emasmi?

681
00:44:28,148 --> 00:44:34,048
Bu biroz zerikarli, lekin odatlanib qolsangiz tez tugaydi.

682
00:44:34,071 --> 00:44:39,987
Dam olish kunlarida birga pishirib, muzlatgichga solib qo‘yish mumkin.

683
00:44:40,010 --> 00:44:44,544
Ha. Ish kunlarida vaqt sarflanmaydi.

684
00:44:44,567 --> 00:44:50,467
Men ham ertadan boshlab biroz ovqat pishirishga harakat qilaman.

685
00:44:50,490 --> 00:44:53,390
Ajoyib!

686
00:44:53,413 --> 00:44:56,166
Nima pishirasiz?

687
00:44:56,189 --> 00:45:01,723
Eng oddiy qovurilgan tuxumdan boshlayman.

688
00:45:01,746 --> 00:45:04,012
Yaxshi.

689
00:45:04,035 --> 00:45:07,469
Nonushta uchun juda mos.

690
00:45:07,492 --> 00:45:12,158
Qozon va tovaga sotib olishimiz kerak.

691
00:45:12,181 --> 00:45:16,766
Dam olish kunida birga supermarketga borib tanlasakmi?

692
00:45:16,790 --> 00:45:19,177
Rahmat.

693
00:45:19,201 --> 00:45:22,034
Iltimos, menga ham ayting.

694
00:45:22,057 --> 00:45:28,090
Pishirishni oʻrgangach, har kuni hayotingiz quvonchli boʻladi.

695
00:45:28,113 --> 00:45:31,813
Tezroq yaxshi pishiruvchi boʻlishni xohlayman.

696
00:45:31,836 --> 00:45:34,624
Sizni qo’llab-quvvatlayman.

697
00:45:34,648 --> 00:45:37,015
Harakat qiling!

698
00:45:37,038 --> 00:45:41,671
Ha, mazali taomlar tayyorlayman.

699
00:45:41,694 --> 00:45:43,194
19-SAHNA: Fasllar boʻyicha kiyimlarni solishtirish

700
00:45:43,194 --> 00:45:47,261
Birdan sovuq boʻldi, shundaymi?

701
00:45:47,284 --> 00:45:53,150
Ha. Qishki kiyimlarni chiqarib olishimiz kerak.

702
00:45:53,173 --> 00:45:58,355
Qishki va yozgi kiyimlardan qaysi biri yoqadi?

703
00:45:58,379 --> 00:46:03,545
Men yozga qaraganda qishni koʻproq yaxshi koʻraman.

704
00:46:03,568 --> 00:46:06,117
Nega?

705
00:46:06,141 --> 00:46:11,853
Qishda turli xil kiyimlarni ustma-ust kiyish mumkin.

706
00:46:11,876 --> 00:46:15,191
Modani zavqlanib kiyish mumkin.

707
00:46:15,215 --> 00:46:20,248
Ha. Palto va sharflar ham juda chiroyli boʻladi.

708
00:46:20,271 --> 00:46:27,771
Men issiqni yoqtirmayman, shuning uchun yozni unchalik yaxshi koʻrmayman.

709
00:46:27,794 --> 00:46:32,927
Men qishga qaraganda yozgi kiyimlarni afzal koʻraman, chunki ular qulay.

710
00:46:32,950 --> 00:46:36,508
Kiyimlar yengil boʻladi-ku.

711
00:46:36,532 --> 00:46:42,232
Ha. Yozgi kiyimlarni yuvish ham osonroq.

712
00:46:42,256 --> 00:46:46,689
Qishki sviterlarni yuvish biroz qiyin boʻladi.

713
00:46:46,712 --> 00:46:51,045
Qishki kiyimlar uchun ximchistkaga pul ham ketadi.

714
00:46:51,068 --> 00:46:56,426
Qishki palto etiklar bilan bir xil narxda turadi.

715
00:46:56,450 --> 00:46:58,950
Shunday.

716
00:46:58,973 --> 00:47:03,316
Univermaglardagi kiyimlar juda qimmat.

717
00:47:03,339 --> 00:47:09,439
Men doimo internetdan arzon kiyimlar sotib olaman.

718
00:47:09,462 --> 00:47:13,229
Oʻlchami mos kelmay qolmaydimi?

719
00:47:13,252 --> 00:47:18,603
Baʼzida boʻladi, lekin sharhlarni diqqat bilan oʻqiyman.

720
00:47:18,626 --> 00:47:22,960
Bu yil qish ayniqsa sovuq boʻlishi aytishadi.

721
00:47:22,983 --> 00:47:26,959
Issiq kiyimlar sotib olish yaxshi boʻlardi.

722
00:47:26,982 --> 00:47:33,415
Ha. Shamollamaydigan uchun qalin ustki kiyim kerak boʻladi.

723
00:47:33,438 --> 00:47:37,940
Sharf va qoʻlqoplarni ham tayyorlab qoʻying.

724
00:47:37,964 --> 00:47:43,431
Dam olish kunida birga xarid qilish uchun chiqsakmi?

725
00:47:43,454 --> 00:47:46,087
Yaxshi.

726
00:47:46,110 --> 00:47:49,343
Bekat oldidagi savdo markaziga boring.

727
00:47:49,366 --> 00:47:54,039
Issiq ramen yeyishni xohlayman.

728
00:47:54,062 --> 00:47:56,596
Ajoyib boʻlardi!

729
00:47:56,619 --> 00:47:59,457
Juda kutaman.

730
00:47:59,481 --> 00:48:03,398
Xaridga borishdan oldin byudjet belgilaymiz.

731
00:48:03,421 --> 00:48:04,921
20-SAHNA: Xizmat safari: Shinkansenmi yoki samolyotmi?

732
00:48:04,921 --> 00:48:11,655
Xizmat safari uchun chiptalarni band qildingizmi? Shinkansenmi yoki samolyotmi, ikkilanyapman.

733
00:48:11,678 --> 00:48:14,781
Samolyot tezroq boʻladi.

734
00:48:14,804 --> 00:48:19,538
Shinkansen samolyotdek tez emas.

735
00:48:19,561 --> 00:48:25,930
Ha. Lekin Shinkansenga oʻtirish samolyotga qaraganda qulayroq.

736
00:48:25,954 --> 00:48:31,220
Yukni topshirish yoki tekshiruvdan oʻtish shart emas-ku.

737
00:48:31,243 --> 00:48:36,910
Shinkansenga bekatga kelganingizda darhol oʻtirishingiz mumkin.

738
00:48:36,933 --> 00:48:41,124
Tayyorgarlik vaqtini tejash yaxshi.

739
00:48:41,147 --> 00:48:47,380
Samolyotga nisbatan, Shinkansendagi oʻrindiqlar kengroq.

740
00:48:47,403 --> 00:48:51,303
Noutbukni ochib ish qilish mumkin.

741
00:48:51,327 --> 00:48:55,914
Ha. Safar vaqtini behuda oʻtkazmoqchi emasman.

742
00:48:55,937 --> 00:48:59,671
Qaysi biri qimmatroq?

743
00:48:59,694 --> 00:49:06,060
Kompaniya toʻlaydi, narxlari deyarli bir xil, lekin Shinkansen biroz arzonroq.

744
00:49:06,083 --> 00:49:11,183
Shinkansen bilan Tokioga necha soat ketadi?

745
00:49:11,206 --> 00:49:14,926
Taxminan toʻrt soat ketadi.

746
00:49:14,949 --> 00:49:18,083
Juda ham uzun ekan, shunaqa?

747
00:49:18,106 --> 00:49:20,703
Charchamaysizmi?

748
00:49:20,726 --> 00:49:26,359
Yoʻlda mazali bentolar yeyishadi, shuning uchun hech qanday muammo yoʻq.

749
00:49:26,382 --> 00:49:31,416
Vokzaldagi bentolar juda koʻp turda boʻlib, juda qiziqarli ekan.

750
00:49:31,438 --> 00:49:37,178
Ha, aynan shu ShinKansenda sayohat qilishning eng katta zavqi.

751
00:49:37,202 --> 00:49:41,591
Men samolyotdan koʻrinadigan manzarani yaxshi koʻraman.

752
00:49:41,615 --> 00:49:46,521
Bulut ustidagi manzara haqiqatan ham goʻzal ekan.

753
00:49:46,544 --> 00:49:52,247
Uzoqqa ketayotganda, boradigan joyingizga qarab qulaylik turlicha boʻladi ekan.

754
00:49:52,271 --> 00:49:57,904
Bu safar ofisim yaqinida vokzal borligi uchun ShinKansenga oʻtirishga qaror qildim.

755
00:49:57,927 --> 00:50:02,446
Bugun tushdan keyin internet orqali band qilaman.

756
00:50:02,470 --> 00:50:06,205
Derazaga yaqin joy olsak yaxshi boʻlardi.

757
00:50:06,228 --> 00:50:10,961
Ha, Fudzi togʻini koʻrish mumkin boʻlgan joyga band qilmoqchiman.

758
00:50:10,984 --> 00:50:14,417
Ehtiyot boʻling, borib keling.

759
00:50:14,440 --> 00:50:16,611
Rahmat.

760
00:50:16,635 --> 00:50:19,935
Souvenirlar olib kelaman.